{"4394520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DoJo Legacy of Zhen", "steam_appid": 4394520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train. Fight. Build a dojo. Leave a legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>DoJo Legacy of Zhen</strong>, you’re creating your own story. Explore the land of <strong>Tianyu</strong>, recruit disciples and train them. Master rare techniques, and step into intense <strong>Martial Arts</strong> <strong>Combat </strong>where timing, counters, and transformation power decide everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as a young martial artist with nothing but potential. The path forward is yours:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train solo through discipline, stances, and environmental challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spar with NPC fighters who grow, remember outcomes, and form rivalries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild and evolve your dojo into a respected school or a feared force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter tournaments, chase fame, and unlock transformation stages through pilgrimage and mastery</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living Martial World🥋 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighters aren’t static. NPCs develop reputations, remember wins/losses, and react to the world around them creating <strong>rivalries, grudges, alliances, and moments that feel earned instead of scripted.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration is free and open combat becomes personal. When tensions ignite, battles kick into a focused <strong>Cinematic Fight</strong> where spacing, reads, stamina, counters, and special moves matter. Power isn’t just numbers it changes how you fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transformations, Styles, and Hybrids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master core styles and climb through transformation stages. Combine disciplines to unlock <strong>hybrid forms</strong> with unique strengths, roles, and tradeoffs earned through training, challenge, and reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martial Arts RPG progression:</strong> grow through practice, technique mastery, and real fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dojo building &amp; evolution:</strong> recruit disciples, raise your dojo level, and shape your school’s identity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC memory &amp; rival system:</strong> the world reacts fighters remember outcomes and evolve over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic battles:</strong> counters, special moves, transformations, and high-impact moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scroll/Technique collection:</strong> learn rare martial techniques and build your fighter’s loadout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournaments &amp; world events:</strong> rise through public challenges where fame and power collide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilgrimages &amp; mastery gates:</strong> earn top-tier transformation unlocks through meaningful trials</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for players who love:</strong> anime-inspired martial worlds, training arcs, rivalry drama, and the satisfaction of becoming dangerous through mastery not just grinding.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train. Fight. Build a dojo. Leave a legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>DoJo Legacy of Zhen</strong>, you’re creating your own story. Explore the land of <strong>Tianyu</strong>, recruit disciples and train them. Master rare techniques, and step into intense <strong>Martial Arts</strong> <strong>Combat </strong>where timing, counters, and transformation power decide everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as a young martial artist with nothing but potential. The path forward is yours:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train solo through discipline, stances, and environmental challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spar with NPC fighters who grow, remember outcomes, and form rivalries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild and evolve your dojo into a respected school or a feared force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter tournaments, chase fame, and unlock transformation stages through pilgrimage and mastery</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living Martial World🥋 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighters aren’t static. NPCs develop reputations, remember wins/losses, and react to the world around them creating <strong>rivalries, grudges, alliances, and moments that feel earned instead of scripted.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration is free and open combat becomes personal. When tensions ignite, battles kick into a focused <strong>Cinematic Fight</strong> where spacing, reads, stamina, counters, and special moves matter. Power isn’t just numbers it changes how you fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transformations, Styles, and Hybrids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master core styles and climb through transformation stages. Combine disciplines to unlock <strong>hybrid forms</strong> with unique strengths, roles, and tradeoffs earned through training, challenge, and reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martial Arts RPG progression:</strong> grow through practice, technique mastery, and real fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dojo building &amp; evolution:</strong> recruit disciples, raise your dojo level, and shape your school’s identity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC memory &amp; rival system:</strong> the world reacts fighters remember outcomes and evolve over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic battles:</strong> counters, special moves, transformations, and high-impact moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scroll/Technique collection:</strong> learn rare martial techniques and build your fighter’s loadout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournaments &amp; world events:</strong> rise through public challenges where fame and power collide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilgrimages &amp; mastery gates:</strong> earn top-tier transformation unlocks through meaningful trials</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for players who love:</strong> anime-inspired martial worlds, training arcs, rivalry drama, and the satisfaction of becoming dangerous through mastery not just grinding.</p>", "short_description": "Dojo Legacy of Zhen, you don't just fight you change history. A emergent martial arts world where every broken bone and bruised ego creates a ripple effect. Defeat a rival, and his disciples will hunt you. Rebuild your school, master the Grudge Engine and forge a legacy in a world that never forgets", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394520/bedfa4031656e646d40eba80e74d204d974ebb82/header.jpg?t=1785442566", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394520/41d0b741a04de5efd0fe5c1d3c099dd2c71e7912/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785442566", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394520/41d0b741a04de5efd0fe5c1d3c099dd2c71e7912/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785442566", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><